<figure class="partner-journey" aria-labelledby="partner-journey-caption">
  <figcaption id="partner-journey-caption">
    <strong>From availability to a confirmed booking</strong>
    <span>Follow the path that applies to your booking. Optional steps depend on the operator’s settings.</span>
  </figcaption>

  <ol class="journey-steps">
    <li>
      <span class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
      <div class="step-content">
        <a class="step-title" href="#make-a-reservation">Select cabins → Hold cabins &amp; continue</a>
        <p>Your selected spaces are held while you complete checkout. Finish before the countdown ends.</p>
        <p class="exit-note">Timer expires → unfinished hold ends and the spaces become available again.</p>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
      <div class="step-content">
        <a class="step-title" href="#place-your-option">Booker details → Review option → Place option</a>
        <p>Your option is submitted. No payment is collected in this checkout. Open Reservations to follow its status.</p>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
      <div class="step-content">
        <a class="step-title" href="#operator-approval">Is operator approval required?</a>
        <div class="journey-branches">
          <div class="branch">
            <strong>Yes → Approval pending</strong>
            <p>The operator reviews your option. Approval moves it to the next step.</p>
            <p class="exit-note">Declined or approval deadline expires → option ends; spaces are released.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="branch branch-skip">
            <strong>No → Skip approval</strong>
            <p>Continue directly to the deposit check.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="step-note">A tentative departure requires operator approval, even with direct booking access.</p>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">4</span>
      <div class="step-content">
        <a class="step-title" href="#deposit-and-payment-responsibility">Is a deposit required?</a>
        <div class="journey-branches">
          <div class="branch">
            <strong>Yes → Deposit pending</strong>
            <p>Follow the payment instructions. The deposit must be recorded as paid to confirm the booking.</p>
            <p class="exit-note">Unpaid at the deadline → the option can be cancelled and spaces released.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="branch branch-skip">
            <strong>No → Skip the deposit</strong>
            <p>The booking can confirm once any required approval is complete.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li class="step-confirmed">
      <span class="step-number" aria-hidden="true">5</span>
      <div class="step-content">
        <a class="step-title" href="#confirmation-and-balance">Confirmed</a>
        <p>Check the remaining balance deadline and complete any outstanding guest information.</p>
        <p class="step-note">Confirmed does not necessarily mean paid in full.</p>
      </div>
    </li>
  </ol>

  <p class="journey-footnote">This is a process overview. Your reservation shows its actual status, payment amounts, and deadlines.</p>
</figure>

